data: {"id": "d4261e7ccbb14be3-thinking-parallel_evidence-878", "run_id": "d4261e7ccbb14be3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的工具结果，对 `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` 的 CrashLoopBackOff 根因证据分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl`\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-07`\n- **UID**: `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, command: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`)\n\n### 2. 支持候选原因的证据 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n- **K8s 状态**: Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段，但容器状态 `Ready=False`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`exitCode=78`，重启次数 `rest", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789075418237, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

