data: {"id": "d4261e7ccbb14be3-final", "run_id": "d4261e7ccbb14be3", "seq": 883, "ts_ms": 1789075436233, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod 容器 `app` 启动后访问 `/work` 端点因配置缺失 (CONFIG_MISSING) 而主动退出 (Exit Code 78)，导致 Kubernetes 陷入 CrashLoopBackOff 重启循环。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error; `container.last_exit_code`: 78; `restart_count`: 14; `container.waiting_reason`: CrashLoopBackOff | 确认 Pod 处于因退出码 78 导致的 CrashLoopBackOff 重启循环中。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.cpu`: 200m; `container.resource_limit.memory`: 96Mi | 排除资源超卖导致的 OOMKilled 或 CPU Throttling，资源配置充裕。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `container.waiting_message`: \"back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app pod=workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl...\" | 描述当前处于等待重启的退避状态。 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | Pattern: `CONFIG_MISSING`, `http_status`: 500, `path`: `/work`, `service`: aiops-lab-workload; Occurrences: 8 (20:57 - 21:18) | 日志聚合确认应用因配置缺失主动报错退出，且与 Trace ID 关联。 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Tempo | `GET /work` (Span `870e7e9c...`), `trace_id`: `64132b2c...`, `status_code`: 500, `aiops.observed_mode`: config_missing_exit | 追踪证据直接证实 `/work` 请求处理失败的模式为配置缺失，且与日志中的 Trace ID 完全一致。 |\n\n**证据链互证说明：**\n- **现象确认**：事实 1 (K8s State) 明确退出码 78，直接指向应用逻辑错误。\n- **根因定位**：事实 4 (Logging) 指出应用主动因 `CONFIG_MISSING` 报错并退出，事实 5 (Tracing) 通过相同的 `trace_id` (`64132b2c...`) 进一步证实了 `/work` 端点确实因该原因返回 500 并退出。\n- **环境排除**：事实 2 (K8s Config) 证明资源限制不是导致退出的原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码配置校验失败 (CONFIG_MISSING) → GET /work 端点返回 500 并主动退出 (Exit Code 78) → Kubernetes 启动失败并进入重启循环 (CrashLoopBackOff) → Pod 持续重启且不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：`workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` Pod 内的 `app` 容器在启动后，其服务逻辑在访问 `/work` 端点时因**配置缺失** (`CONFIG_MISSING`) 主动触发了退出流程，导致容器以 **Exit Code 78** 失败退出，进而被 Kubernetes 反复重启。\n\n**关键证据支撑：**\n1. **Kubernetes State**: `container.last_exit_code` 为 `78`，配合 `restart_count: 14` 证实了崩溃重启循环。\n2. **Logging**: 聚合日志明确记录了 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误模式，且发生在 `/work` 路径上。\n3. **Tracing**: Temp 数据展示了完全对应的 `GET /work` 请求 (Trace ID: `64132b2c...`)，其应用状态明确为 `config_missing_exit` 且返回 500，与日志和退出原因完全吻合。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 62.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 62.3s (Evidence 56.6s, RCA 5.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 93.563, "metrics": {"run_id": "d4261e7ccbb14be3", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 93.56998562812805, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 93569.98562812805, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 89124.37129020691, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 11404.217958450317, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4035.189628601074}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19021.406888961792, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 62311.50436401367, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12211.34638786316, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

